# i18n and UX states

- No new user-facing string hard-coded in JS/HTML.
- Add **SR + DE + EN** keys together in the existing i18n system (`translations.js` / project helpers).
- Errors: what happened + next safe action.
- Disabled controls: reason when not obvious.
- Loading / success / error / conflict / empty must be real states, not visual improvisation.
- Preserve existing a11y patterns (labels, focus, keyboard).
- Do not introduce a parallel design system; reuse BusCommand tokens/components.
